[{"client_msg_id":"d8b686e6-0ff2-4bba-a770-f7caed5f06c9","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"自分が散文を吐き出すのはネタ出しの段階ですね。こういう内容書きたいなあ、ってのをとりあえず書いてみる。後で取捨選択してまとめていく。","ts":"1621781899.106700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruho","count":4,"users":["U01HFNMNB55","U9S4G0LJW","UFHQ7TNT0","UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l+OE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e944096-28e2-4864-808d-b3c71547a9d0","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"正直2chまとめとかtogetterじゃないけどここの会話をいい感じに切り取ってまとめて欲しい","ts":"1621781836.106000","thread_ts":"1621781836.106000","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2ZeW8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"546e9345-8b4c-4718-bd47-dfc497fae558","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":muscle:","ts":"1621781834.105900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sJ0j7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"A73B6648-0008-4FA0-B54A-77B08AD94A99","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"途中でなんか違うと思ったら、もう一度上から書きなおしますね","ts":"1621781824.105500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P=qF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c8a84ca9-d975-4d64-ac7b-61ab1643691c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"推敲というか容赦なく否定してくるので手が完全に止まる","ts":"1621781794.104400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vgp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dadb5a4d-c356-47cf-b153-1db0402391f0","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"吐き出す段階で推敲する自分を止めるためなのでそれが無いなら必要無さそう","ts":"1621781780.103900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FoN1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"FADEDA5B-38E5-43AD-90A1-82C5BF69CF40","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"流れの中で考えが収束していくのかな","ts":"1621781771.103700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sm3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b4f1dac3-776e-4ce3-b315-303b843c3d86","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"Wikiみたいな構造で吐き出すのは好きですけど、私も散文はないですねー\nなんか意味があるのかイマイチわからなくて","ts":"1621781736.102800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XKT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"99174ac2-810e-43ea-9f07-3cd740612394","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"その書き方できないのでちょっと羨ましい","ts":"1621781715.102200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8TK0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"74B7B5E3-F719-4829-9BE7-6E9DEF65B928","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"散文吐き出しはしたことないなぁ。わりと上から順番に書いていかないと続きが書けないタイプだ","ts":"1621781690.101600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y4gbo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7711d786-83af-4574-9177-5cf228ededa7","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"散文吐き出して整理するのよくやるなあ。その後整った文に直すのに苦労するわけなんですが","ts":"1621781637.100200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y=f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e66dc709-178c-4ee4-bb2d-c8ba7ed26fcd","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"チャットは受動的だからやりやすいんですよね（相手も待ってるしタイミングもあるし）。Scrapは能動的にやらなくちゃいけないから","ts":"1621781615.099700","edited":{"user":"U7B4ZD49X","ts":"1621781634.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3TD3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5141e8d4-7bcc-4699-8520-6f3c58f29bd8","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"チャット＋pickedでいい感じになって欲しい","ts":"1621781589.099000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D=Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3a6d9a8c-c509-4905-8557-daf9183f9170","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"会社timesとか個人Slackでラバーダック、たまにやりますw\nただその気分が長時間持たないのでつらい…","ts":"1621781572.098800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q0R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bf93e0bf-e9fc-4a24-afa4-07d1c894f7c3","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"もしくはZennのScrapみたいな細かい単位で文章を切れるやつ","ts":"1621781530.097600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oLb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"80f37289-f1a3-4536-bc63-62fb2fbd0da5","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"瞬間脳内ダンプは楽なんですけどね。長時間ダンプするのは苦痛になる","ts":"1621781524.097200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]},{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uyXU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"351648f9-a18f-477e-8634-c661c0f5b8a6","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"日本語は筆が乗るときはのるなあ\nそうでないときはダメ","ts":"1621781499.096200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yahat"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9a359052-ccb2-4cd8-901b-b20a382d802e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"個人Slackに散文吐き出して整理するという手も","ts":"1621781487.095700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mELl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b79e893-d504-429d-8d94-664d9d60c88c","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"twitterとかslackは息を吸うようにできても、まとまった文章はなかなか厳しい…","ts":"1621781459.095100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gfB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"BB5BFC4A-2865-40B1-9C5E-897A1B277748","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"みんな降りてくるの待ってるんじゃないですかね","ts":"1621781390.093700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uBUo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bdbd0ba4-2af5-4c74-843f-e5eb69f4ae0a","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"なんか筆が進む日とそうでない日があるんですが、経験上進まない日のほうが多いという…","ts":"1621781316.092400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Sd7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"142EEF8D-5845-4C59-9618-D682B35D7DBA","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"それでも勢いでもいいから書き切るのやっぱり大事ですね。まずは書き切らないと永遠に公開できないので。","ts":"1621781295.091800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hai-small","count":3,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","UD1FQV38V","UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nq5s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bab9ecda-5791-4cdd-9e3e-3394ada51a04","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"だいたい筆の勢いに任せて書ききっちゃってから推敲します。そのときに頭抱えるときも多いけど…","ts":"1621781104.089800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=SnNu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"305e1f7b-0e18-4fed-be47-362df8637688","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"書いてる日によって気分が変わるのあるある。私は一旦その日のノリで書いて、後日冷静になった頭で読み返して全部直しますね","ts":"1621781063.089000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/5YML"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f785f4bd-4839-4ca3-bd98-6d4577f13673","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"私そういうふうにやるとその日・その時の気分で、紹介テイストで書こうと思ってたのに煽っちゃったり、固く書こうと思ってたのにボケまくったりしちゃいそう・・・","ts":"1621781007.087600","edited":{"user":"U7B4ZD49X","ts":"1621781366.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"warau","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]},{"name":"aruaru","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mxe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b2457e53-ebfd-4637-bbeb-04e56166dffe","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"でも私の場合、タイトルだけじゃなく文章構成すら迷ってばっかりだなあ。Vim 関連に限っても、なんかいい感じにまとまらなくて結局お蔵入りになってしまった記事がいくつもある…","ts":"1621780964.086400","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1621780995.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7Ub"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b75bba32-8c73-4cda-ae66-391d8521416d","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"Abstract最初に決まってる系(本とか、査読付き発表とか)は変えられないのでブログくらいは、みたいなのはわかりますw\n最近とあるカンファレンスのCfP書いてたんですが、通ったらAbstractから乖離しないように原稿書くの大変そう、みたいに思ってます","ts":"1621780962.086300","edited":{"user":"UD1FQV38V","ts":"1621781035.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Tez"}]},{"client_msg_id":"928fdf9f-ba69-415d-933c-3dccc5dc0deb","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"もちろん「こういう話を書きたい」ってのはあるんで、最初に仮タイトルは書いたりしますけどね。後で何回も直すことが多いな、という感じです。","ts":"1621780848.083400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8XgoD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"320dc939-fb17-4c5f-8276-7bc2205abb50","type":"message","user":"U01HFNMNB55","text":"僕は記事のポエム力が高まるにつれてタイトルも後付けになる感じ","ts":"1621780847.083300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lFAOy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"BE598618-24A4-4399-B405-1C370A56713F","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"本だと脱線できないから、ブログくらい脱線したいみたいな感覚がある。","ts":"1621780801.082400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y0jgY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c549de9d-d6af-4046-98b1-4eeff3a974d2","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"意外だった。みんなタイトル最初に書いてると思い込んでた","ts":"1621780780.081400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v3ZF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B915BAE4-9063-4487-86C1-46A20252F9E9","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"僕は書きながらわりと脱線するから、タイトル最後が多いんですよね","ts":"1621780753.080900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YGyn/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"40bd69bb-72b4-4bbd-89cd-f984ce91b7ec","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"\u0026gt; タイトルって本文の流れ決めるから\nたぶん私はこの意識で書いてないですね。Qiita の記事のタイトルはあくまで客を引きつける看板みたいなもの、と割り切ってます\n（もちろん本文と乖離しないようにはするけど）","ts":"1621780679.079700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]},{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=i6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3867037-9501-4408-b4bf-9218e6a8ed2b","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"へー。それ絶対ないなー。もう落ちまで作ってある","ts":"1621780676.079600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mdzg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4d367d37-7e59-45ab-bbb4-a0e65f298f67","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"逆に書いてて「これ本文と乖離してるな、変えるか」みたいなのを雑にやりがちです","ts":"1621780639.078500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ejV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57b06571-817b-4f87-ac98-778b2fcf295c","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"プロジェクト名っていうか基礎（どういうフレームワーク使うかとかどういうドメインの切り方にするかとかそういうところ）みたいなところですね。タイトルって本文の流れ決めるから","ts":"1621780618.077700","edited":{"user":"U7B4ZD49X","ts":"1621780743.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G5FtJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6f210a75-42a2-455a-bb7c-6b499d26c9e1","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"プログラミングの場合プロジェクト名は最初に決める（じゃないと後々困る場合がある）んですが、記事のタイトルは後からいくらでも変更できるんで、いつまでも迷っちゃうんですよねえ","ts":"1621780583.076500","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1621780601.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ad3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a57e208f-2ad2-4700-953b-94b3b8b32774","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"自分の中の軸みたいなの確立してやらないとふわふわして全然集中できない","ts":"1621780531.075000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+uFUi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0f6eb1b0-e101-41f8-a228-895e8495d719","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"というかプログラミングも一緒かも。私ある程度下回り揃えないと書き始められないタイプなんで","ts":"1621780496.074400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3=E9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"78d75312-976a-4c7d-ae70-2b4d1eaf674d","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"私は記事のタイトルなかなか決まらないですねー。平凡なタイトルにしようか、いやここはちょっとキャッチーなやつにしちゃおうか、とか色々考えてしまう","ts":"1621780447.073700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dk/W8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"511d84eb-5058-498b-9c2d-282a457b335b","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"タイトルいいのが思いつけば先に決めちゃうけど、だいたい自分はあとからだな…","ts":"1621780428.073300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y7ygX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c9198288-af3b-4b37-b5d9-78360c0c1ac1","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"（というかノリが違う文章書いちゃいそうになる）","ts":"1621780426.073200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gt2T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ef699ea2-5ff9-43f7-aea8-2bc595ba4a51","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"私タイトル先ですねーある程度話の流れ決まってからじゃないとなにもできない","ts":"1621780366.071500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7w3d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"37DE71B5-7D2B-4359-8090-5E070E1FFB83","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"そういえば、エンジニアの楽園記事はめずらしくタイトルを先に決めて内容を考えていったんですよね。\n普段は記事を書いてから、公開直前にいい感じのタイトルをつけることが多いんですけど、今回は「エンジニアの楽園 vim-jp」っていうワードが先に思い浮かんで響きが気に入ったので、それにあわせて本文を構成しました。その流れでvim-jp案内もタイトルからつけました。","ts":"1621780280.070700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UL6CFN8NR","U06ECBRTJ"]},{"name":"hee","count":2,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bSu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"313aa611-0370-422f-b9e3-1376987f7881","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://qiita.com/ichimonji_haji/items/96fb2e7c482ed77dea07\u003e\nそして完全理解の難易度","ts":"1621772236.063800","attachments":[{"fallback":"Qiita: 「CSS完全に理解した」でCSS完全に理解する - Qiita","id":1,"title":"「CSS完全に理解した」でCSS完全に理解する - Qiita","title_link":"https://qiita.com/ichimonji_haji/items/96fb2e7c482ed77dea07","text":"1：導入 例の「CSS完全に理解した」Tシャツ。 色々な方が話している通り、あれを意図的にやろうとすると実はなかなか難しい。 むしろ、「CSS完全に理解した」を再現するコードを書くたびに我々はCSSの完全理解に近づけるんじ...","image_url":"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.qiita.com%2Fassets%2Fpublic%2Farticle-ogp-background-1150d8b18a7c15795b701a55ae908f94.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0\u0026w=1200\u0026mark=https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-user-contents.imgix.net%2F~text%3Fixlib%3Drb-4.0.0%26w%3D840%26h%3D380%26txt%3D%25E3%2580%258CCSS%25E5%25AE%258C%25E5%2585%25A8%25E3%2581%25AB%25E7%2590%2586%25E8%25A7%25A3%25E3%2581%2597%25E3%2581%259F%25E3%2580%258D%25E3%2581%25A7CSS%25E5%25AE%258C%25E5%2585%25A8%25E3%2581%25AB%25E7%2590%2586%25E8%25A7%25A3%25E3%2581%2599%25E3%2582%258B%26txt-color%3D%2523333%26txt-font%3DHiragino%2520Sans%2520W6%26txt-size%3D54%26txt-clip%3Dellipsis%26txt-align%3Dcenter%252Cmiddle%26s%3D4338cf7abf08d7cfc47cbab4fac5b726\u0026mark-align=center%2Cmiddle\u0026blend=https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-user-contents.imgix.net%2F~text%3Fixlib%3Drb-4.0.0%26w%3D840%26h%3D500%26txt%3D%2540ichimonji_haji%26txt-color%3D%2523333%26txt-font%3DHirag