画処理を省略し高速化したり、あるいは視点から遠い順に描画することで半透明の物体の重なりを正確に表現したりするために使われることもある。2次元コンピュータグラフィックスにおいて、オブジェクトの重なりを表現する場合にもZオーダーが使われる。","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/Z%E3%82%AA%E3%83%BC%E3%83%80%E3%83%BC","original_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/Z%E3%82%AA%E3%83%BC%E3%83%80%E3%83%BC"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9qm9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"194089b8-4d3a-4aa3-aa2f-654e3f2ef9a3","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"z-index による順序付けの方法だと実現できない配置とかがあるんですよね。三つ巴になってるような配置。","ts":"1621769112.056100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WPHtL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0034c80c-98c6-466f-bfe4-833c705ecc7f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"CSSじゃないけどちょっと前にHTMLのCanvasのfillTextの座標系にキレた","ts":"1621769094.055600","edited":{"user":"U9S4G0LJW","ts":"1621769105.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SvxmK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bbd84547-c03a-447c-9244-12c1c6c23254","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"z-index 2147483647だと・・・！ばかな！ありえない","ts":"1621769064.054800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J7dNU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eac3b5f6-18cc-4336-87f4-a9d338fda733","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"左手座標系か右手座標系か","ts":"1621769062.054700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CsanD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7f1a163d-3031-4221-b92f-761bb284d0ee","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"肝心の x 軸と y 軸の向きは時と場合によりバラバラなんですけどねー…","ts":"1621769049.054000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["UD1FQV38V","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":